ive director\", with the founders being accurately identified as Tony Chen and Nick Kuan.\n\nSection 4\nReaders are invited to contact the Readers’ Editor with further inquiries or concerns via post, email, or telephone. The detailed contact information is provided for transparency and accessibility. This open line of communication underscores The Guardian's dedication to reader satisfaction and continuous improvement. The corrections page serves as a vital tool for maintaining trust between the publication and its audience, showcasing a proactive approach to accuracy.\n\nP.P.S. Further updates and corrections can be found on The Guardian's official website, encouraging readers to stay informed about any changes to published articles.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Section", "logprob": -0.3049810826778412}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -8.702239938429557e-06}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -8.821448318485636e-06}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.009044628590345383}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.011395839974284172}, {"token": " Guardian", "logprob": -0.013004845008254051}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.23157557845115662}, {"token": " issued", "logprob": -0.11207876354455948}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.8449032306671143}, {"token": " series", "logprob": -0.07494916766881943}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -2.7418097943154862e-06}, {"token": " corrections", "logprob": -0.020619560033082962}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.021350663155317307}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.8557031154632568}, {"token": " news", "logprob": -0.4740832448005676}, {"token": " articles", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.24552401900291443}, {"token": " aiming", "logprob": -0.014064598828554153}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -4.410734163684538e-06}, {"token": " provide", "logprob": -2.3540077209472656}, {"token": " accuracy", "logprob": -0.32018983364105225}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.004712190479040146}, {"token": " clarity", "logprob": -0.05631089210510254}, 